msgid "**Isolation is gVisor on top of in-app sandboxing; Firecracker is out of reach on this engine.** Each agent app runs under `runtime: runsc`, a userspace guest kernel that intercepts syscalls before they reach the host, so untrusted model-generated code stays kernel-isolated even if the app's own sandbox is bypassed. No custom VMM, jailer wiring, or bespoke rootfs pipeline. E2B/Beam noted as alternatives in the role README but not adopted."
