msgstr ""

msgid "Every runner instance is an ephemeral container that mounts its host’s docker socket (DooD). For each CI job it starts a fresh Infinito DinD container with a unique subnet and volume, runs the job inside it, and tears it down; the runner then re-registers with GitHub as a fresh ephemeral runner."
