msgid "[`roles/web-app-openwebui/templates/env.j2`](../../roles/web-app-openwebui/templates/env.j2) sets `ENABLE_PERSISTENT_CONFIG=false`. API changes to environment-backed connection state MUST be treated as runtime state that has to be reconciled after every container restart; a deploy-only one-shot is insufficient."
